      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for pointing that out. i checked the software output again and the values are definitely correct as i typed them. i think i might be fundamentally misunderstanding the relationship between them though. can you walk me through why the interval crossing zero is such a problem for significance? like, if the p-value is below 0.05, shouldn't that automatically mean the effect is real even if the interval is a bit wide?",
